Scope / 적용 범위

The MIT License above covers the code in this repository (src/, scripts/,
worker/, tests/, schemas/, config files) and the documentation (docs/,
README.md). The following parts are NOT covered by it:

1. Content written by the operator — screen copy (src/copy/), Korean
   descriptions (data/catalog-ko/), glossary (data/glossary.json), starter kits
   (data/kits.json), search word groups (data/search-words.json) — is licensed
   under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0,
   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Credit "코드잇소 (codeitso)".
   Where a line is based on a source's original text, that source's terms
   apply as well.
2. Collected catalog data (data/catalog/, data/catalog-models/,
   data/catalog-media/) comes from public sources. Each file states its
   source and terms in "source.license"; see docs/DATA.md and the site's
   /about/credits page (for example, ecosyste.ms metadata is CC BY-SA 4.0).
   Every listed product keeps its own license.
3. The names "코드잇소" and "codeitso" and the logo (assets-src/brand/,
   public/brand/, site icons) are not licensed. If you publish a modified
   version, use a different name and logo.
4. Third-party components (fonts, icons, vendored skills) keep their own
   licenses; see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

위 MIT 라이선스는 이 저장소의 코드와 문서에 적용된다. 운영자가 쓴 글(화면 글·한국어 설명·
용어 풀이·스타터 키트·검색 같은 뜻 묶음)은 CC BY 4.0, 공개 출처에서 받은 진열대 자료는 각 출처의
조건, 이름 「코드잇소」·「codeitso」와 로고는 허락하지 않음, 제3자 구성 요소는 각 라이선스를 따른다.
